{
  "book": "helaman",
  "bookName": "Helaman",
  "chapter": 7,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 412.038,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, now it came to pass in the sixty and ninth year of the reign of the judges over the people of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.285,
      "end": 13.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Nephi, the son of Helaman, returned to the land of Zarahemla from the land northward.",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 14.234,
      "end": 18.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he had been forth among the people who were in the land northward,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 18.826,
      "end": 21.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did preach the word of God unto them,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 21.56,
      "end": 24.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did prophesy many things unto them;",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 24.887,
      "end": 30.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did reject all his words, insomuch that he could not stay among them,",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 30.408,
      "end": 33.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but returned again unto the land of his nativity.",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 34.385,
      "end": 37.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And seeing the people in a state of such awful wickedness,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 38.094,
      "end": 45.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those Gadianton robbers filling the judgment-seats\u2014 having usurped the power and authority of the land;",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 45.333,
      "end": 47.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "laying aside the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 47.928,
      "end": 53.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not in the least aright before him; doing no justice unto the children of men;",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 54.32,
      "end": 57.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Condemning the righteous because of their righteousness;",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 57.658,
      "end": 62.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "letting the guilty and the wicked go unpunished because of their money;",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 62.854,
      "end": 68.798,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and moreover to be held in office at the head of government, to rule and do according to their wills,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 68.978,
      "end": 72.089,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might get gain and glory of the world,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 72.269,
      "end": 76.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and, moreover, that they might the more easily commit adultery",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 78.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and steal,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 78.295,
      "end": 79.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and kill,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 79.543,
      "end": 81.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do according to their own wills\u2014",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 82.499,
      "end": 87.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this great iniquity had come upon the Nephites, in the space of not many years;",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 87.834,
      "end": 89.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when Nephi saw it,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 89.686,
      "end": 92.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his heart was swollen with sorrow within his breast;",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 92.885,
      "end": 95.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did exclaim in the agony of his soul:",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 96.305,
      "end": 98.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Oh, that I could have had my days",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 98.714,
      "end": 103.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the days when my father Nephi first came out of the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 103.584,
      "end": 106.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I could have joyed with him in the promised land;",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 106.875,
      "end": 109.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then were his people easy to be entreated,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 109.702,
      "end": 112.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "firm to keep the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 112.668,
      "end": 115.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and slow to be led to do iniquity;",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 115.727,
      "end": 118.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were quick to hearken unto the words of the Lord\u2014",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 119.518,
      "end": 122.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, if my days could have been in those days,",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 122.624,
      "end": 126.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then would my soul have had joy in the righteousness of my brethren.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 127.53,
      "end": 130.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I am consigned that these are my days,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 130.775,
      "end": 136.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that my soul shall be filled with sorrow because of this the wickedness of my brethren.",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 137.26,
      "end": 140.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, now it came to pass that it was upon a tower,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 140.877,
      "end": 143.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was in the garden of Nephi,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 143.425,
      "end": 144.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was by the highway",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 145.138,
      "end": 147.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which led to the chief market,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 147.686,
      "end": 150.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was in the city of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 150.513,
      "end": 154.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, Nephi had bowed himself upon the tower which was in his garden,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 155.012,
      "end": 159.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which tower was also near unto the garden gate by which led the highway.",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 160.522,
      "end": 163.773,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there were certain men passing by",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 163.953,
      "end": 168.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and saw Nephi as he was pouring out his soul unto God upon the tower;",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 168.87,
      "end": 171.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they ran and told the people what they had seen,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 171.976,
      "end": 174.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the people came together in multitudes",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 174.989,
      "end": 180.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might know the cause of so great mourning for the wickedness of the people.",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 180.917,
      "end": 182.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, when Nephi arose",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 183.047,
      "end": 186.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he beheld the multitudes of people who had gathered together.",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 187.582,
      "end": 191.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he opened his mouth and said unto them:",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 191.338,
      "end": 194.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, why have ye gathered yourselves together?",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 194.444,
      "end": 196.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That I may tell you of your iniquities?",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 197.492,
      "end": 199.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, because I have got upon my tower",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 200.04,
      "end": 207.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might pour out my soul unto my God, because of the exceeding sorrow of my heart, which is because of your iniquities!",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 208.243,
      "end": 210.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because of my mourning and lamentation",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 211.117,
      "end": 214.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye have gathered yourselves together, and do marvel;",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 214.548,
      "end": 216.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and ye have great need to marvel;",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 216.957,
      "end": 218.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, ye ought to marvel",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 218.762,
      "end": 220.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because ye are given away",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 220.8,
      "end": 223.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the devil has got so great hold upon your hearts.",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 224.499,
      "end": 228.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, how could you have given way to the enticing of him",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 228.208,
      "end": 230.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who is seeking to hurl away your souls",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 230.71,
      "end": 233.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "down to everlasting misery and endless wo?",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 234.176,
      "end": 235.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O repent ye, repent ye!",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 236.121,
      "end": 237.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why will ye die?",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 237.648,
      "end": 239.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Turn ye, turn ye unto the Lord your God.",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 240.15,
      "end": 241.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why has he forsaken you?",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 242.409,
      "end": 245.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It is because you have hardened your hearts;",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 245.19,
      "end": 248.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, ye will not hearken unto the voice of the good shepherd;",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 248.76,
      "end": 251.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, ye have provoked him to anger against you.",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 252.273,
      "end": 254.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, instead of gathering you,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 255.054,
      "end": 256.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except ye will repent,",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 256.906,
      "end": 259.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he shall scatter you forth",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 259.547,
      "end": 262.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye shall become meat for dogs and wild beasts.",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 263.431,
      "end": 265.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O, how could you have forgotten your God",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 266.026,
      "end": 268.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the very day that he has delivered you?",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 269.214,
      "end": 273.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, it is to get gain, to be praised of men,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 273.295,
      "end": 275.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and that ye might get gold and silver.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 275.936,
      "end": 280.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye have set your hearts upon the riches and the vain things of this world,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 280.388,
      "end": 282.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the which ye do murder,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 282.611,
      "end": 283.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and plunder,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 283.906,
      "end": 285.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and steal,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 285.201,
      "end": 287.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bear false witness against your neighbor,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 287.982,
      "end": 290.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do all manner of iniquity.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 290.891,
      "end": 294.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And for this cause wo shall come unto you except ye shall repent.",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 294.786,
      "end": 296.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For if ye will not repent,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 296.777,
      "end": 298.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, this great city,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 298.815,
      "end": 302.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also all those great cities which are round about,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 302.664,
      "end": 306.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are in the land of our possession, shall be taken away",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 307.116,
      "end": 309.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye shall have no place in them;",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 309.479,
      "end": 316.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, the Lord will not grant unto you strength, as he has hitherto done, to withstand against your enemies.",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 316.986,
      "end": 319.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 319.349,
      "end": 324.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will not show unto the wicked of my strength, to one more than the other,",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 324.359,
      "end": 327.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be unto those who repent of their sins,",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 327.604,
      "end": 329.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hearken unto my words.",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 329.549,
      "end": 332.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now therefore, I would that ye should behold, my brethren,",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 332.887,
      "end": 337.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it shall be better for the Lamanites than for you except ye shall repent.",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 337.979,
      "end": 340.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they are more righteous than you,",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 340.853,
      "end": 342.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they have not sinned",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 342.798,
      "end": 345.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "against that great knowledge which ye have received;",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 345.811,
      "end": 348.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore the Lord will be merciful unto them;",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 349.01,
      "end": 352.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he will lengthen out their days and increase their seed,",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 352.673,
      "end": 356.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even when thou shalt be utterly destroyed except thou shalt repent.",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 357.115,
      "end": 362.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, wo be unto you because of that great abomination which has come among you;",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 362.264,
      "end": 364.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye have united yourselves unto it,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 364.952,
      "end": 368.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, to that secret band which was established by Gadianton!",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 369.254,
      "end": 375.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, wo shall come unto you because of that pride which ye have suffered to enter your hearts,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 375.378,
      "end": 380.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which has lifted you up beyond that which is good because of your exceedingly great riches!",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 381.491,
      "end": 385.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, wo be unto you because of your wickedness and abominations!",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 386.211,
      "end": 388.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And except ye repent ye shall perish;",
      "verse": "7:28",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 388.759,
      "end": 391.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even your lands shall be taken from you,",
      "verse": "7:28",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 391.633,
      "end": 395.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall be destroyed from off the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "7:28",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 395.889,
      "end": 399.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold now, I do not say that these things shall be, of myself,",
      "verse": "7:29",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 399.831,
      "end": 402.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because it is not of myself that I know these things;",
      "verse": "7:29",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 402.983,
      "end": 405.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, I know that these things are true",
      "verse": "7:29",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 405.903,
      "end": 408.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because the Lord God has made them known unto me,",
      "verse": "7:29",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 408.916,
      "end": 411.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I testify that they shall be.",
      "verse": "7:29",
      "lineIndex": 118
    }
  ]
}